          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#6b5b95;--muted:#6c6f73;--bg:#fff;--card:#fbfbfc;--radius:14px;--max:1100px}\\n    body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial;line-height:1.45;color:#222;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#f7f6fb 100%)}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;color:var(--accent)}\\n    .navlinks a{color:#444;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}\\n    .navlinks a[href$=\\\"about.html\\\"]{background:rgba(107,91,149,0.08)}\\n    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(17,15,20,0.06)}\\n    .hero h2{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:28px;color:#111}\\n    .hero p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .gallery{margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:16px}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;flex:1}\\n    .section{margin-top:28px}\\n    .grid-3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}\\n    footer{margin-top:36px;border-top:1px solid #eee;padding-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .svg-wrap{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;}\\n    @media (max-width:900px){header.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .grid-3{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <nav>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <svg width=\\\"56\\\" height=\\\"56\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:12px;background:#f3eef8;padding:8px\\\">\\n          <rect x=\\\"6\\\" y=\\\"6\\\" width=\\\"88\\\" height=\\\"88\\\" rx=\\\"16\\\" fill=\\\"#f7f4fb\\\"></rect>\\n          <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#6b5b95\\\"></circle>\\n          <rect x=\\\"28\\\" y=\\\"64\\\" width=\\\"44\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#cdbfe6\\\"></rect>\\n        </svg>\\n        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"navlinks\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"approach.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </nav>\\n\\n    <header class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card hero\\\">\\n        <h2>Meet {{THERAPIST_NAME}} — a calm, collaborative listener</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"meta\\\">I work with adults navigating anxiety, life transitions, relationships, and the lingering effects of trauma. Therapy is a partnership: we track what matters, set clear goals, and choose steps that fit your life.</p>\\n        <p>Licensed in {{STATE}} ({{LICENSE}}). I offer telehealth and limited in-person sessions in {{CITY}}. Sessions are private and confidential; see the footer for scope and crisis information.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n        <!-- unique inline SVG for about page hero -->\\n        <svg class=\\\"svg-wrap\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 600 420\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#efe9fb\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#e6f0fb\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n          <g transform=\\\"translate(60,50) scale(0.9)\\\">\\n            <ellipse cx=\\\"220\\\" cy=\\\"160\\\" rx=\\\"140\\\" ry=\\\"90\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.6\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M60 200c40-70 140-80 210-30\\\" stroke=\\\"#6b5b95\\\" stroke-width=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"220\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" r=\\\"36\\\" fill=\\\"#6b5b95\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n        <p style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px\\\">A visual metaphor for spacious, layered attention — calm, contained, present.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h3>Client perspectives</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"gallery\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"I finally feel seen.\\\"</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Therapy felt practical and steady. We worked at a sustainable pace and I learned tools that I use every week.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>\\\"The VIP Day shifted things.\\\"</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">A focused, single-day intensive helped me clarify a plan and try new strategies between sessions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h3>What I offer and why it helps</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Collaborative care</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">You bring context; I bring evidence-informed skills. Together we prioritize goals and adapt as you change.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Practical skills</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Breathing, cognitive tools, boundary work, and experiments that fit your life — not a one-size-fits-all checklist.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h4>Clear planning</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">We break big change into small steps and check progress. Growth is measured in chosen actions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h3>How we typically move forward</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <ol>\\n          <li><strong>Connect:</strong> A brief consult to see fit and logistics.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Map:</strong> Clarify priorities and craft short-term goals.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Work:</strong> Mix of session content, home practice, and mid-course checks.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Review:</strong> Reassess and decide next steps — ongoing sessions, time-limited work, or a focused intensive.</li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h3>Try a focused option</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h4>Renewal VIP Day</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"meta\\\">A single full-day session (6 hours) to create a clear plan and practice skills in a concentrated, supportive space. For clients who want an accelerated start or a reset between regular sessions.</p>\\n        <p><strong>Investment:</strong> Flat investment available; payment plans offered. Contact for current rates.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h3>Questions people often ask</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid-3\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>How long until I feel better?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Change varies. We set short-term checkpoints and practical goals so you can see small wins as you go.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Do you accept insurance?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">I provide superbills for out-of-network reimbursement. Contact me directly about details.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Is telehealth available?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"meta\\\">Yes — telehealth is available across {{STATE}} when permitted. In-person availability is limited in {{CITY}}.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section\\\">\\n      <h3>Resource: short guide</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <p>Sign up for a concise worksheet: \\\"Checkpoint Plan — 5 small steps for the next 30 days.\\\" No spam — practical, brief, and for people who want immediate structure.</p>\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\">\\n          <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email\\\" style=\\\"padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6ea;\\\" required>\\n          <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">Get the Worksheet</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>{{THERAPIST_NAME}} — {{LICENSE}}. {{BUSINESS_NAME}} maintains client confidentiality in accordance with professional standards. This website is informational and not a substitute for emergency services. If you are in crisis or danger, contact local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</p>\\n      <p>Scope and boundaries: I do not provide forensic evaluations, court testimony, or emergency crisis services via this site. Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}.</p>\\n      <p>Contact: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"specialties.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Areas of Focus — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#2a9d8f;--muted:#4a4f55;--bg:#fff;--card:#fcfffd;--radius:12px;--max:1150px}\\n    body{font-family:Georgia,serif;color:#182026;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#f4fbfa 100%);margin:0}\\n    .outer{max-width:var(--max);margin:28px auto;padding:22px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}\\n    .nav a{margin-left:12px;color:#385a56;text-decoration:none}\\n    .title{font-size:24px;color:var(--accent);margin:6px 0}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:68%}\\n    .visual{width:360px}\\n    .list{margin-top:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}\\n    .spec{background:var(--card);padding:16px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(42,157,143,0.06)}\\n    .spec h4{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:9px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #e9f3ef;padding-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.lead{max-width:100%}.visual{display:none};.list{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"outer\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <h2 class=\\\"title\\\">Where I focus my clinical attention</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Gentle, practical psychotherapy for people seeking clarity, steadiness, and better relational patterns. I draw from {{MODALITIES}} to tailor work for your needs.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\\\"visual\\\">\\n        <!-- unique inline SVG for specialties page -->\\n        <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 300 220\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n          <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#f0f8f6\\\"/>\\n          <g transform=\\\"translate(30,20)\\\">\\n            <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"100\\\" height=\\\"140\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"#2a9d8f\\\" opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n            <rect x=\\\"120\\\" y=\\\"20\\\" width=\\\"140\\\" height=\\\"100\\\" rx=\\\"8\\\" fill=\\\"#2a9d8f\\\" opacity=\\\"0.08\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"80\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#2a9d8f\\\" opacity=\\\"0.2\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 160c40-30 120-30 180-10\\\" stroke=\\\"#2a9d8f\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" opacity=\\\"0.14\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"color:#113033\\\">Common areas I support</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <h4>Anxiety & Worry</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Coping strategies, pattern identification, and gradual exposure to reclaim daily functioning and reduce avoidance.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <h4>Trauma-informed care</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Stabilization, safety planning, and gentle processing. We prioritize regulation and pacing over pushing for memory recall.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <h4>Relationships & Communication</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Boundary work, clearer expression of needs, and repairing patterns that repeat across relationships.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <h4>Burnout & Life transitions</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Reassessing values, designing sustainable routines, and making intentional changes rather than reactive decisions.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"color:#113033\\\">How I shape short-term work</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Many clients find 8–12 sessions useful for specific goals; others prefer ongoing weekly work. I also offer targeted intensives for people who need concentrated support.</p>\\n        <p><strong>Specialty program:</strong> Clinical Compass Program — a 3-month guided series with measurable checkpoints and mixed session types (telehealth + optional intensive).</p>\\n        <p><strong>Investment framing:</strong> Program-based pricing with tiered options (core package, expanded accountability add-on). Sliding scale openings available for limited slots.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"color:#113033\\\">Process snapshot</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>1. Brief consult</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">15–20 minutes to assess fit and logistics.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>2. Intake & plan</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">We co-create goals and decide on session rhythm.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>3. Skill practice</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Action-oriented tools and in-between exercises tailored to your life.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"color:#113033\\\">Questions you might have</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Will you share records with employers?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">No. Information is confidential except in legally specified situations (danger to self/others, court orders). We discuss limits of confidentiality during intake.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n          <strong>Can we try a single-session intensive?</strong>\\n          <p class=\\\"note\\\">Yes. I offer single-day intensives for focused planning or skills immersion. These are scheduled separately from weekly slots.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"color:#113033\\\">Grab a quick resource</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"spec\\\">\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Download the \\\"Boundary Conversation Guide\\\" — a short email workbook to practice asking for what you need. No cost.</p>\\n        <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\">\\n          <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email for the guide\\\" style=\\\"padding:9px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e8f3f0;\\\" required>\\n          <button class=\\\"cta\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">Send the Guide</button>\\n        </form>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}, {{LICENSE}} — Confidentiality is a core value. This site is informational only and not for crisis care. If you are at risk, call local emergency services or your crisis line. Modalities include {{MODALITIES}}. Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"approach.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>My Approach — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--accent:#b56576;--muted:#555;--bg:#fff;--card:#fff7f9;--radius:16px;--max:1080px}\\n    body{font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto; margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,#fff9fb 100%);color:#1b1b1b}\\n    .container{max-width:var(--max);margin:36px auto;padding:20px}\\n    header{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .nav a{margin-left:10px;color:#8b3a4f;text-decoration:none}\\n    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0}\\n    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:20px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .panel{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(181,101,118,0.06)}\\n    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .step{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #fde6ea}\\n    .faq{margin-top:18px}\\n    .leadmag{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}\\n    .leadmag input{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #f3d7dd}\\n    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #fde6ea;padding-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:920px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>Therapeutic approach</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"sub\\\">A practical, compassionate frame that centers your values and day-to-day life.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"nav\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"specialties.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n      <main>\\n        <section class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <h3>Foundations</h3>\\n          <p>I blend short-term, skills-focused elements with deeper explorations when needed. Expect consistent structure: weekly check-ins, measurable small goals, and room for reflection. Approaches include elements from {{MODALITIES}}, attunement to interpersonal context, and a trauma-informed pacing.</p>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n          <h3>Stepwise engagement</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"steps\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>1. Intake & safety</strong><p class=\\\"sub\\\">We prioritize safety, collect clinical history, and set immediate supports.</p></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>2. Goal co-design</strong><p class=\\\"sub\\\">Short, concrete goals make progress visible and actionable.</p></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>3. Skill application</strong><p class=\\\"sub\\\">We try interventions in-session and adapt exercises that fit your daily life.</p></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"step\\\"><strong>4. Review & next steps</strong><p class=\\\"sub\\\">We check progress and collaboratively decide whether to continue, pause, or switch focus.</p></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n        <section class=\\\"panel faq\\\">\\n          <h3>Frequently asked (different set)</h3>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>What if therapy brings up strong emotions?</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"sub\\\">We approach intense material with regulation tools first. You control pacing; we only progress when you feel safe enough to do so.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <strong>How do we measure progress?</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"sub\\\">We set simple, observable goals (e.g., fewer avoidance behaviors, improved sleep, clearer conversations) and revisit them regularly.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n            <strong>What if I need a different therapist?</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"sub\\\">I offer referrals and help with warm handoffs when a different specialty or setting is a better fit.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </section>\\n\\n      </main>\\n\\n      <aside>\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\">\\n          <!-- unique inline SVG for approach page avatar -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 160 160\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n            <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"#fff2f5\\\"/>\\n            <g transform=\\\"translate(20,16)\\\">\\n              <circle cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"40\\\" r=\\\"28\\\" fill=\\\"#b56576\\\" opacity=\\\"0.95\\\"/>\\n              <rect x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"80\\\" width=\\\"84\\\" height=\\\"8\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#f5d6db\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M4 96c30-12 88-12 120 0\\\" stroke=\\\"#b56576\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/>\\n            </g>\\n          </svg>\\n          <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"sub\\\">Licensed: {{LICENSE}} — Practices across {{STATE}}. Modalities: {{MODALITIES}}.</p>\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a consult</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h4>Short program: Root & Reach Intensive</h4>\\n          <p class=\\\"sub\\\">A three-session concentrated track for people ready to clarify a challenge quickly. Includes a planning session, a skills session, and a review with a written plan.</p>\\n          <p><strong>Pricing note:</strong> Per-package pricing (three-session bundle). Sliding scale considered on a limited basis.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"panel\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <h4>Get a free handout</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"leadmag\\\">\\n            <form action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"get\\\">\\n              <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email address\\\" required>\\n              <button class=\\\"btn\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send checklist</button>\\n            </form>\\n          </div>\\n          <p class=\\\"sub\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Checklist: \\\"If I'm feeling stuck — 8 small shifts to try this week.\\\"</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Confidential care, ethically bounded. This website provides general information and is not crisis support. If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services. For urgent mental health needs, contact local emergency resources or a crisis line. Contact: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
